{
  "length_scale": 1.0,
  "total": 51.37,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "l01",
      "text": "You've been manifesting for two years.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "dur": 1.904,
      "end": 1.904,
      "gap": 0.28
    },
    {
      "id": "l02",
      "text": "Vision board. Morning routine. A folder full of screenshots.",
      "start": 2.184,
      "dur": 4.128,
      "end": 6.312,
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "id": "l03",
      "text": "What you don't have is the thing.",
      "start": 6.862,
      "dur": 1.632,
      "end": 8.494,
      "gap": 0.7
    },
    {
      "id": "l04",
      "text": "Here's the uncomfortable part. Manifestation works.",
      "start": 9.194,
      "dur": 3.128,
      "end": 12.322,
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "id": "l05",
      "text": "Attention really does shape outcome. Which is exactly why they sell it to you.",
      "start": 12.822,
      "dur": 4.44,
      "end": 17.262,
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "id": "l06",
      "text": "Every scroll is a vision board somebody else built.",
      "start": 17.812,
      "dur": 2.72,
      "end": 20.532,
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "id": "l07",
      "text": "A thousand lives a day. None of them yours.",
      "start": 21.082,
      "dur": 2.952,
      "end": 24.034,
      "gap": 0.7
    },
    {
      "id": "l08",
      "text": "You're not manifesting. You're being manifested through.",
      "start": 24.734,
      "dur": 3.144,
      "end": 27.878,
      "gap": 0.7
    },
    {
      "id": "l09",
      "text": "Because almost arriving feels better than arriving.",
      "start": 28.578,
      "dur": 2.736,
      "end": 31.314,
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "id": "l10",
      "text": "So the feed keeps you almost there. Forever.",
      "start": 31.764,
      "dur": 2.52,
      "end": 34.284,
      "gap": 0.7
    },
    {
      "id": "l11",
      "text": "A wish and a plan differ by one thing. A cost.",
      "start": 34.984,
      "dur": 3.144,
      "end": 38.128,
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "id": "l12",
      "text": "Hours. Discomfort. Something you give up.",
      "start": 38.678,
      "dur": 2.72,
      "end": 41.398,
      "gap": 0.6
    },
    {
      "id": "l13",
      "text": "Name the price and it stops being manifestation. It starts being a life.",
      "start": 41.998,
      "dur": 4.28,
      "end": 46.278,
      "gap": 0.7
    },
    {
      "id": "l14",
      "text": "You can visualize the bus all day. It still only stops if you're standing there.",
      "start": 46.978,
      "dur": 4.392,
      "end": 51.37,
      "gap": 0.0
    }
  ]
}